# argument                           |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .......................................................................................................
input                                |   string       |  mandatory  |   - #DST file
variations                           |   string       |  mandatory  |   - #universes text file
config                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
output                               |   string       |  optional   |   tweaks_[PARAMS].root
ntoys                                |   integer      |  optional   |   1000
mesg-thresholds                      |   string       |  optional   |   verbosity.xml
params                               |   string       |  optional   |   allsyst
kine-var                             |   string       |  optional   |   ereco
sample                               |   string       |  optional   |   numulikeCChigh
detector                             |   string       |  optional   |   sbn_nd
syst-from-quantiles, syst-from-rms   |   boolean_list |  optional   |   syst-from-quantiles
